il. Let me use \"...\" as the universally understood notation for silence, or perhaps just a single quiet marker.\n\nI'll go with \"...\" — it's the closest textual representation of silence. Or maybe even better: nothing but an empty beat.\n\nHmm, some might argue silence could be expressed as \"( )\" or a blank. But \"...\" is standard.\n\nFinal answer: ..."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":112,"completion_tokens":449,"total_tokens":561,"cached_tokens":112,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":433},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":112}}}